  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">World Bank Externally Financed Output to do: 1) survey of SMEs to gather information on their existing access to finance; and (2) value chain analysis of the construction sector in Lebanon.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity World Bank Externally Financed Output to do: 1) survey of SMEs to gather information on their existing access to finance; and (2) value chain analysis of the construction sector in Lebanon.  is a component of Lebanon Enterprise Employment Programme reported by FCDO with a funding type of 109 - Multilateral organisation and a budget of &#xa3;150,000. It works in the following sector(s): Small and medium-sized enterprises (SME) development, Business policy and administration.</narrative>
  </description>
